# Secrets the Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for when it sets up a new
# instance. Signs sessions and encrypts the GitHub App's credentials:
# generate one with `openssl rand -base64 32`, keep a copy somewhere safe,
# and never change it.
#
# For local development, copy this to .dev.vars, fill it in, and add
# TACK_DEV_AUTH=1 for fake sign-in at /auth/dev (local only; never set it in
# production).
TACK_SECRET=
